Z||000000||Loki||03-13-2001||06:15 PM||||Things are not going good at all between my and my gf Dawn. And I dont know if they will get better. Only problem I have though is that if we do split up what do I do about mu son Luke? Im so stressed out over this..PLease someone shoot me (j/k)<P><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/loki137/loki5.jpg">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/headshot.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroLisa||03-13-2001||08:21 PM||||Loki I'm no relationship expert, but then again I've been in similar situations. Sometimes you need to take a break to appreciate someone, to know how much you love them and need them, and vice versa. Not a break to go around and find someone new, necessarily, but to step back and re start a friendship with your girlfriend. Sometimes you get so caught up in the fighting you forgot the reasons you two fell in love and had a son.<BR>If you drag on the relationship as it is, your son will be affected, he will feel the tension and sometimes kid's see that as their fault.<P>Hope I'm of some help<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
